=*Auto-Unblock: TTL Expired*
IP `{{ $json.ip_address }}` has been unblocked (TTL expired).
*Incident:* {{ $json.incident_id }} | *Type:* {{ $json.detection_type }} | *Severity:* {{ $json.severity }}
*Blocked:* {{ $json.blocked_at }} | *Expired:* {{ $json.expires_at }}
*Deployment:* {{ $json.deployment_type }}

=*Auto-Unblock FAILED - Manual Action Required*
Failed to unblock IP `{{ $json.ip_address }}` (attempt {{ $json.unblock_attempts }}/3).
*Incident:* {{ $json.incident_id }} | *Type:* {{ $json.detection_type }}
*Error:* {{ $json.error_detail }}
*Deployment:* {{ $json.deployment_type }}
Please manually remove the block rule.

=*Block List Health Report*
*Currently Blocked:* {{ $json.currently_blocked }}
*Unblocked Last 24h:* {{ $json.unblocked_last_24h }}
*Stuck Blocks (max retries):* {{ $json.stuck_blocks }}
*Max Retries Exceeded:* {{ $json.max_retries_exceeded }}
{{ parseInt($json.stuck_blocks) > 0 ? 'ACTION REQUIRED: Some IPs could not be automatically unblocked. Manual review needed.' : 'All systems nominal.' }}

